# Symbols Security.framework exports, used to generate the SDK's
# Security.framework/Security.tbd so <Security/Security.h> and
# -framework Security both resolve from -isysroot. A tbd built from this file
# has no dependency on the built framework, which is what keeps the SDK out of
# its own build closure - the same reason libSystem.exports exists.
#
# Regenerate after changing what the framework exports:
#   nix build .#security
#   nm -gU result/System/Library/Frameworks/Security.framework/Versions/A/Security
# (external, section-defined symbols only, sorted).
